{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/0b91c1e44c568692926df65e4d837758.avif?t=1765461173\" width=920 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fablery is a tactical card game where heroes from myths and legends across the world clash on a board. Hades versus Alice, Dracula against Cleopatra, every fight opens the door to unexpected encounters and surprising twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/cd0e31d78bc514dc5ac82ea8d5564146.avif?t=1765461173\" width=920 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero comes with a unique deck that reflects their personality and powers. No deckbuilding required \u2013 jump straight into the action. Deploy your units, predict your opponent\u2019s moves, and turn the tide of battle through smart tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/693e041e96d6f6c94498807c6015e34a.avif?t=1765461173\" width=920 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fablery, your units aren\u2019t static. They move across a board, adding an extra layer of strategy to classic card-game mechanics. Protect your Hero at all costs, set up traps, rush into battle, or carefully plan your approach \u2013 the way you play defines the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/ce9b0cb87b8fa44db0ebd8b89184910e.avif?t=1765461173\" width=920 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face opponents in <strong>intense 1v1 battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>solo thematic missions</strong> built around your favorite heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend and fight another duo in <strong>2v2 mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>progressively more challenging puzzles</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love card games, tactical combat, or timeless myths, Fablery offers a unique, accessible experience filled with unforgettable duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/aa99549b39432a70ce154c674d8a7bfd.avif?t=1765461173\" width=920 height=180 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445440?t=1765461173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445440?t=1765461173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/593a261c4a9333bbf823d056489d2736d97d43c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765461173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/593a261c4a9333bbf823d056489d2736d97d43c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765461173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item